===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun|head=[[south|South]] [[Australia]]}}

# {{place|en|One of the six <<states>> of <<c/Australia>>}}, located in the central southern part of the continent, with its capital at [[Adelaide]].
# {{lb|en|historical}} Until 1901, the British colony that is now the state of South Australia.

